s-internals/", "title": "L3 Scaling \u3068 Performance \u5f37\u5316 \u5185\u90e8\u5b9f\u88c5\uff08RouteOrch bulk / fpmsyncd / sairedis / show arp\uff09", "content_html": "L3 Scaling \u3068 Performance \u5f37\u5316 HLD \u306e\u5185\u90e8\u5b9f\u88c5\u3002RouteOrch \u306e bulk route API (gRouteBulker) \u3068 1 \u79d2 timer flush\u3001fpmsyncd \u306e rt_table==0 lookup \u30b9\u30ad\u30c3\u30d7\u3001sairedis JSON \u66f4\u65b0\u3001show arp / show ndp \u306e\u500b\u5225 FDB lookup \u5316\u3092\u5b9f\u88c5\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\u4f4d\u7f6e\u3068\u5408\u308f\u305b\u3066\u89e3\u8aac\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/internals/l3-scaling-and-performance-enhancements-internals.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T05:31:23+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T20:56:08+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/", "title": "\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6 (Glossary)", "content_html": "\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6 (Glossary) \u2014 SONiC NOS \u3067\u983b\u51fa\u3059\u308b\u56fa\u6709\u7528\u8a9e\u30fb\u7565\u8a9e\u30fb\u30b3\u30f3\u30dd\u30fc\u30cd\u30f3\u30c8\u540d\u30fb\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u30d9\u30fc\u30b9\u540d\u30fb\u30c7\u30fc\u30e2\u30f3\u540d\u3092\u3001\u30a2\u30eb\u30d5\u30a1\u30d9\u30c3\u30c8\u9806\u306b\u6574\u7406\u3057\u305f\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6\u3067\u3059\u3002\u5404\u30a8\u30f3\u30c8\u30ea\u306f\u300c\u7528\u8a9e / \u7565\u79f0 / \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u8a33 / \u7c21\u6f54\u306a\u8aac\u660e / \u95a2\u9023\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u300d\u306e\u5f62\u5f0f\u3067\u8a18\u8f09\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/glossary.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T05:31:23+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T18:14:52+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/config-muxcable/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/config-muxcable/", "title": "config muxcable \u30b5\u30d6\u30b3\u30de\u30f3\u30c9", "content_html": "config muxcable \u306f Dual-ToR \u69cb\u6210\u3067\u4f7f\u7528\u3059\u308b Y-Cable (NIC \u2194 ToR-A / ToR-B) \u306e\u72b6\u614b\u3068\u4f4e\u30ec\u30a4\u30e4\u6a5f\u80fd (PRBS, loopback, FW, FEC, ANLT \u7b49) \u3092 CLI \u304b\u3089\u64cd\u4f5c\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/cli/config-muxcable.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T05:31:23+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T19:51:57+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/verification/discrepancy-index/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/verification/discrepancy-index/", "title": "HLD \u3068\u5b9f\u88c5\u306e\u4e56\u96e2 \u4e00\u89a7\uff08discrepancy-index\uff09", "content_html": "HLD \u3068\u5b9f\u88c5\u306e\u4e56\u96e2 \u4e00\u89a7\uff08discrepancy-index\uff09 \u2014 verification: discrepancy-found \u304c\u4ed8\u3044\u305f\u5168\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3092 monitor subtype \u5225\u306b\u5206\u985e\u3057\u305f\u4e00\u89a7\u3002meta/scripts/gen_discrepancy_index.py \u3067\u751f\u6210\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/verification/discrepancy-index.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T05:31:23+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T07:19:44+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-mclag/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-mclag/", "title": "sonic-mclag YANG", "content_html": "sonic-mclag YANG \u2014 MCLAG\uff08Multi-Chassis LAG\uff09\u30c9\u30e1\u30a4\u30f3\u30fb\u30a4\u30f3\u30bf\u30d5\u30a7\u30fc\u30b9\u30fbUnique IP \u3092\u5b9a\u7fa9\u3059\u308b YANG \u30e2\u30b8\u30e5\u30fc\u30eb\u3002\u30d4\u30a2\u9593\u306e keepalive / session timeout \u7b49\u306e\u30d1\u30e9\u30e1\u30fc\u30bf\u3092 CONFIG_DB \u306b\u4fdd\u6301\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/yang/sonic-mclag.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T05:31:23+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T19:33:01+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/switching/wake-on-lan-in-sonic/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/switching/wake-on-lan-in-sonic/", "title": "Wake-on-LAN\uff08wol CLI \u3068 SonicWolService gNOI\uff09", "content_html": "SONiC \u306e Wake-on-LAN \u6a5f\u80fd\u3002Rust \u5b9f\u88c5\u306e wol CLI \u306b\u3088\u308b Magic Packet \u9001\u51fa (Ethernet / UDP \u4e21\u5f62\u5f0f) \u3068\u3001HLD \u304c\u63d0\u6848\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b SonicWolService gNOI \u7d4c\u8def\u306e\u5b9f\u88c5\u72b6\u6cc1\u3092\u6574\u7406\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/switching/wake-on-lan-in-sonic.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T05:31:23+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T13:15:13+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/08-qos-buffer/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/08-qos-buffer/", "title": "QoS / Buffer / PFC / Watermark", "content_html": "QoS / Buffer / PFC / Watermark \u2014 \u3053\u306e\u7ae0\u306f\u3001SONiC \u306e\u300cASIC \u306e\u30d0\u30c3\u30d5\u30a1\u3092\u3069\u3046\u5206\u3051\u308b\u304b\u300d\u300c\u30ad\u30e5\u30fc\u3092\u3069\u306e\u9806\u3067\u51fa\u3059\u304b\u300d\u300c\u6df7\u3093\u3060\u3089\u8ab0\u306b\u6b62\u307e\u3063\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3046\u304b\u300d\u300c\u6df7\u307f\u5177\u5408\u3092\u3069\u3046\u6e2c\u308b\u304b\u300d\u3092\u3001\u8aad\u307f\u624b\u306e\u8cea\u554f\u9806\u306b\u307e\u3068\u3081\u76f4\u3057\u305f\u3082\u306e\u3067\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/08-qos-buffer/index.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T05:31:23+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T01:34:48+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/08-qos-buffer/architecture/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/08-qos-buffer/architecture/", "title": "QoS / Buffer \u306e\u30a2\u30fc\u30ad\u30c6\u30af\u30c1\u30e3", "content_html": "QoS / Buffer \u306e\u30a2\u30fc\u30ad\u30c6\u30af\u30c1\u30e3 \u2014 ConfigDB \u306e QoS / buffer \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u304c\u3001\u6700\u7d42\u7684\u306b SAI \u306e\u3069\u306e\u30aa\u30d6\u30b8\u30a7\u30af\u30c8\u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3059\u308b\u304b\u3001\u305d\u3057\u3066\u3069\u306e daemon \u304c\u6a4b\u6e21\u3057\u3092\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b\u304b\u3092\u307e\u3068\u3081\u307e\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/08-qos-buffer/architecture.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T05:31:23+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T01:34:48+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/09-telemetry-snmp/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/09-telemetry-snmp/", "title": "Telemetry / SNMP / Observability", "content_html": "Telemetry / SNMP / Observability \u2014 \u3053\u306e\u7ae0\u306f\u3001SONiC \u3067\u300c\u3044\u307e\u30b9\u30a4\u30c3\u30c1\u304c\u4f55\u3092\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b\u304b\u300d\u300c\u58ca\u308c\u305f\u3068\u304d\u4f55\u304c\u8d77\u304d\u305f\u304b\u300d\u3092\u8aad\u3080\u305f\u3081\u306e\u6a5f\u80fd\u7fa4\u3092\u307e\u3068\u3081\u307e\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/09-telemetry-snmp/index.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T05:31:23+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T01:32:14+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/09-telemetry-snmp/advanced/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/09-telemetry-snmp/advanced/", "title": "\u767a\u5c55\u30c8\u30d4\u30c3\u30af", "content_html": "\u767a\u5c55\u30c8\u30d4\u30c3\u30af \u2014 \u3053\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u306f\u3001\u57fa\u672c\u306e observability \u7d4c\u8def\uff08CLI / counter / SNMP / gNMI / techsupport\uff09\u304b\u3089\u5916\u308c\u308b\u3001\u5c02\u9580\u89b3\u6e2c\u6a5f\u80fd\u3068\u6700\u8fd1\u306e telemetry \u62e1\u5f35\u3092\u307e\u3068\u3081\u307e\u3059\u3002\u8a2d\u8a08\u5224\u65ad\u306b\u76f4\u7d50\u3059\u308b\u5c40\u9762\u4ee5\u5916\u306f\u6df1\u8ffd\u3044\u4e0d\u8981\u3067\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/09-telemetry-snmp/advanced.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T05:31:23+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T01:32:14+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/", "title": "gNMI / gNOI / OpenConfig / YANG", "content_html": "gNMI / gNOI / OpenConfig / YANG \u2014 \u3053\u306e\u7ae0\u306f\u3001SONiC \u306e\u300c\u30e2\u30c7\u30eb\u99c6\u52d5\u7ba1\u7406\u300d\u3092\u3001\u30ea\u30af\u30a8\u30b9\u30c8\u304c\u5165\u308b\u5165\u53e3\u304b\u3089 ConfigDB \u306b\u5230\u9054\u3059\u308b\u307e\u3067\u306e\u9806\u3067\u8aad\u307f\u76f4\u3059\u305f\u3081\u306e\u5165\u53e3\u3067\u3042\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/index.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T05:31:23+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T01:29:20+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/operations/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/operations/", "title": "\u904b\u7528", "content_html": "\u904b\u7528 \u2014 gNMI \u3092\u904b\u7528\u3059\u308b\u5c40\u9762\u3067\u306f\u3001\u8907\u6570\u30af\u30e9\u30a4\u30a2\u30f3\u30c8\u304c\u540c\u3058 device \u3092\u89e6\u308b\u7af6\u5408\u5236\u5fa1\u3001\u518d\u8d77\u52d5\u3092\u8de8\u3044\u3067\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3092\u6b8b\u3059 save-on-set\u3001collector \u3078 push \u3059\u308b dial-out telemetry\u3001subscription \u306e\u5b89\u5b9a\u6027\u304c\u8ab2\u984c\u306b\u306a\u308b\u3002\u305d\u308c\u305e\u308c\u306e HLD \u3092\u4e00\u671b\u3067\u304d\u308b\u3088\u3046\u306b\u307e\u3068\u3081\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/operations.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T05:31:23+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T01:29:20+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}]}